              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report feeling relief after the supervisor agreed one case could wait, followed by embarrassment for having treated both as life-or-death situations."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "8ec64875-0df0-4fc8-bc6f-1f0e4bab7394"
