              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e35988b9-3d19-4ed2-8837-05e18c32153b"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient had a conversation with Nora about their tendency to act like they want space when stressed, even when they actually need someone nearby."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e35988b9-3d19-4ed2-8837-05e18c32153b"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Nora responded positively, offering to ask whether the patient wants company or quiet instead of guessing."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "6973dbe7-bf72-4b76-833e-96ffb583d25c"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "1907d336-952c-4fdc-a406-8cdb185b746d"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient felt vulnerable during this conversation, noting they are used to making their needs invisible so others don't have to accommodate them."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "cd94714a-3a49-4936-ba41-d7c258ffb047"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b11fa98d-a753-496e-97f2-bb25b0723694"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "a9473963-3262-44a2-a60c-cf6a0305ff79"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They recognize that making their needs invisible leads to feeling lonely and resentful.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "1d096449-7a61-491d-a36c-42d63fe560ec"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6ab8f2ad-5551-4375-afaf-6abb7fe40887"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d8b258f0-3be1-4516-853f-63884b60df55"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient also discussed a similar pattern with their sister, who calls to check in."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "6ab8f2ad-5551-4375-afaf-6abb7fe40887"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d8b258f0-3be1-4516-853f-63884b60df55"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient typically says they are fine because their sister has her own life, then feels sad that their sister doesn't know what's going on."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "a5fc9494-7dd5-4aa4-b75b-a3e9e740e273"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b97ecff8-9418-4259-87ad-c2257bf9213f"
