              {
                "SegmentId": "100adc48-8188-4c19-b6c6-57e2242a8181"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They were able to recognize the guilt as \"the old voice\" and refrained from sending an apology text.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "3ff1dbc5-44d4-4da8-8ef8-1a12ee7d0465"
