              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "c25fd062-9161-494e-be16-0f2a68f84963"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient also discussed a pattern of feeling obligated to repay help immediately, which leads to taking on more than they have capacity for."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "45ff65e3-1edb-4f69-8310-1a5dd13f6145"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f7458736-d722-405c-8eca-d37b490e6e5a"
